# CNAME.pending holds manjulab.com and is deliberately NOT committed yet.
# GitHub Pages redirects <org>.github.io/<repo> to the custom domain the moment
# a CNAME file exists — which would make the site unreachable until the
# Cloudflare records are switched. Commit it as `CNAME` at the same time as the
# DNS change, not before. See README "Deploying".
CNAME.pending
